## Control: a pointer coupled to the identity

* `arenaObs_one`; ★ `idxPointerShift_one` — a pointer coupled to the identity advances at the
  uniform rate `−2 f'(θ₂)` whatever the carrier does. It reads the flow parameter and no clock.
  This is the case §6 of the contract warns of.

## The comparison with the uncoupled carrier

* ★ `norm_idxCarrierU_sub_le`, ★ `abs_arenaObs_idxCarrierU_sub_le`,
  ★ `abs_integral_arenaObs_idxCarrierU_sub_le`, ★★ `abs_idxPointerShift_sub_le`.

## The level swap

* `levelSwap`, `levelSwap_isHermitian`, `levelSwap_mulVec_zero`, `levelSwap_mulVec_one`,
  `levelSwap_mul_self`, `norm_levelSwap_le`;
