## The clock in the joint energy and the Hamiltonian flow

* `deviceHam_isHermitian`, `clockIdx`, `clockArenaEquiv`, `clockB`, `clockB_isHermitian`,
  `norm_clockB_le`;
* `clockPointerEnergy`, `contMDiff_clockPointerEnergy`, `clockPointerEnergy_eq`,
  `idxCoupledH_clock`;
