## The ideal hand

* `clockQuad`, `re_exp_mul_eq_clockQuad`, `clockQuad_eq_norm_mul_cos`, `continuous_clockQuad`,
  `abs_clockQuad_le`, ★ `clockQuad_eq_zero_iff`;
* `clockHand`, `clockHand_zero`, `hasDerivAt_clockHand`, ★ `integral_clockQuad`,
